  Nura on Motorola Xoom - community device port (NuraXoom), not an official Nura release
  Wi-Fi ............. Sxmo > Networks   (or: nmtui)
  Display driver .... nuraxoom-display status|auto|opentegra|modesetting
  Logs .............. /sdcard/NuraXoom/logs  (also readable from TWRP)
  Android storage ... ~/sdcard  (/mnt/userdata/media/0)
  Packages .......... doas apk update && doas apk add <pkg>
